      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Grief is an incredibly painful part of losing someone, and there is no neat point to explain why leaving feels this hard. Many people endure empty mornings and lonely mornings even when they would never wish to lose one. Knowing that this feeling will eventually change, even when you don't think it can, is the only path forward.",
      "source": "target",
